{"unit_id":"tag:06CG:proof","translation":"选取一个可表（representable）的叠（stack），它取值于群胚（groupoids），记为<MATH_0001>，以及一个满射（surjective）、光滑（smooth）的<MATH_0002>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0005>为对象（object），它属于<MATH_0006>且在<MATH_0007>上。<MATH_0008>-纤维积（fibre products）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>可表（representable）为代数空间（algebraic spaces），且满射（surjective）、光滑（smooth），因为它是<MATH_0010>的基变换（base change），见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>。由对<MATH_0011>的对角（diagonal）所作的条件，可知此态射（morphism）的源可表（representable）为代数空间（algebraic space），见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0003>。因此，由《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0004>，其靶是代数叠（algebraic stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"group